[Host] It means the situation, or the state of affairs.

43
00:05:09,396 --> 00:05:18,851
[Slow] 情勢の悪化で、原油の価格が上がり、材料の値段も高くなりました。

44
00:05:19,651 --> 00:05:25,387
[Host] Because of that, crude oil prices went up, and the cost of raw materials rose too.

45
